            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi nella lista <code>cart</code> la tupla <code>(\"jeans\", 70)</code>, seguita da <code>(\"sweater\", 90)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;t-shirt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;jeans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;sweater&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[('t-shirt', 40), ('jeans', 70), ('sweater', 90)]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>(\"jeans\", 70)</code> e poi <code>,</code>, <code>(\"sweater\", 90)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il carrello affinché stampi <code>[('t-shirt', 40), ('jeans', 70), ('sweater', 90)]</code>. Aggiungi le coppie <code>(\"jeans\", 70)</code> e <code>(\"sweater\", 90)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"cart = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;t-shirt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;jeans&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;sweater&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;jeans&quot;, 70]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[('t-shirt', 40), ('jeans', 70), ('sweater', 90)]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>(\"jeans\", 70)</code>, <code>,</code> e infine <code>(\"sweater\", 90)</code>.</p></body></html>",
